## Pull Requests & Commits

- Follow **Conventional Commits**: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `docs:`, `chore:`.
- Keep commits small and focused on a single concern.
- Run `npm test` locally before opening a PR.
- PR descriptions must include: what changed, why, and any migration or env var additions.
- Never force-push to `main`.

